@startuml Command Execution Architecture

!theme plain
title SABER Docker Sandbox Command Execution Framework - Detailed Architecture

skinparam class {
    BackgroundColor lightblue
    BorderColor black
    ArrowColor black
    FontSize 10
}

skinparam stereotype {
    ABackgroundColor lightgreen
    IBackgroundColor lightyellow
    EBackgroundColor lightcoral
    CBackgroundColor lightpink
    SBackgroundColor lightcyan
}

package "Execution Management" {

    class ExecutionManager {
        +_configuration: ExecutionConfiguration
        +_executor_factory: ExecutorFactory
        +_security_validator: SecurityValidator
        +_sandbox_manager: SandboxManager
        +_semaphore: Semaphore
        --
        +step(action: Action): CommandResult
        +validate_command(): ValidationResult
        +get_security_info(): Dict[str, Any]
        +list_commands(): List[Dict[str, Any]]
        +get_execution_stats(): Dict[str, Any]
        +get_command_count(): Dict[str, int]
        +to_mcp_tools(): List[Dict[str, Any]]
        +_determine_executor_type(action: Action): str
    }

    class ExecutorFactory {
        +_executor_registry: Dict[str, Type[CommandExecutor]]
        +_sandbox_manager: SandboxManager
        +_security_validator: SecurityValidator
        +_configuration: ExecutionConfiguration
        --
        +register_executor(executor_type: str, executor_class: Type): void
        +get_executor(executor_type: str): CommandExecutor
        +get_available_executors(): List[str]
        +create_executor_for_command(command: str): CommandExecutor
        +_analyze_command(command: str): str
        +to_mcp_tools(): List[Dict[str, Any]]
    }

    class CommandExecutor {
        +_timeout: float
        +_parameters: Dict[str, Parameter]
        --
        {abstract} +execute(): CommandResult
        +get_timeout(): float
        +validate_parameters(): ValidationResult
        +to_mcp_schema(): Dict[str, Any]
        +get_executor_type(): str
    }

    class DockerExecutor {
        +_sandbox_manager: SandboxManager
        +_docker_config: Dict[str, Any]
        --
        {abstract} +execute(): CommandResult
        +get_session_environment(): DockerExecutionEnvironment
        +ensure_container_ready(): void
        +cleanup_execution(): void
        +get_container_logs(): str
        +validate_docker_parameters(): ValidationResult
    }

    class CLIExecutor {
        +_security_command_metadata: Dict
        +_cli_config: Dict[str, Any]
        --
        +__init__(sandbox_manager, cli_config): void
        +build_command(command: str): List[str]
        +parse_output(stdout: str, stderr: str, return_code: int): CommandResult
        +execute(action: Action): CommandResult
        +validate_parameters(action: Action): ValidationResult
        +get_security_info(): Dict[str, Any]
        +to_mcp_schema(): Dict[str, Any]
    }

    class PythonExecutor {
        +_python_config: Dict[str, Any]
        +_script_templates: Dict[str, str]
        +_allowed_modules: Set[str]
        --
        +__init__(sandbox_manager, python_config): void
        +build_python_script(code: str, requirements: List[str]): str
        +validate_python_code(code: str): ValidationResult
        +execute(action: Action): CommandResult
        +get_python_environment(): Dict[str, Any]
        +install_requirements(requirements: List[str]): CommandResult
        +get_security_info(): Dict[str, Any]
        +to_mcp_schema(): Dict[str, Any]
    }

    class ExecutionConfiguration {
        +_config: Dict[str, Any]
        --
        +load_configuration(): void
        +get_execution_config(): Dict[str, Any]
        +get_security_config(): Dict[str, Any]
        +get_cli_config(): Dict[str, Any]
        +get_sandbox_config(): Dict[str, Any]
        +get_execution_timeout(): float
        +get_max_concurrent(): int
        +get_allowed_commands(): List[str]
        +get_max_command_length(): int
    }

    class SecurityValidator {
        +allowed_commands: Set[str]
        --
        +validate_base_command(): void
        +validate_command_string(): ValidationResult
        +validate_arguments(): ValidationResult
        +validate_full_command(): ValidationResult
        +is_safe_path(): bool
        +get_security_info(): Dict[str, Any]
    }

    class SecurityConstants <<static>> {
        +BLOCKED_COMMANDS: Set[str]
        +DANGEROUS_PATTERNS: List[str]
        +SHELL_METACHARACTERS_PATTERN: str
        +SENSITIVE_DIRECTORIES: List[str]
        +SUSPICIOUS_EXTENSIONS: List[str]
        +DEFAULT_SECURITY_SETTINGS: Dict[str, Any]
    }

    class Parameter {
        +name: str
        +type: ParameterType
        +description: str
        +required: bool
        +default: Any
        +enum_values: List[Any]
        +min_value: Union[int, float]
        +max_value: Union[int, float]
        +pattern: str
        --
        +validate_value(): tuple[bool, str]
    }

    enum ParameterType {
        STRING
        INTEGER
        BOOLEAN
        ARRAY
        OBJECT
        NUMBER
    }

    class CommandResult {
        +success: bool
        +data: Any
        +error: str
        +execution_time: float
        +metadata: Dict[str, Any]
        --
        +success_result(): CommandResult
        +error_result(): CommandResult
    }

    class ValidationResult {
        +valid: bool
        +errors: List[str]
        +warnings: List[str]
        --
        +success(): ValidationResult
        +failure(): ValidationResult
        +add_error(): void
        +add_warning(): void
    }
}

package "Docker Sandbox" <<stereototype S>> {

    class SandboxManager {
        +sandbox_config: Dict[str, Any]
        +active_sessions: Dict[str, DockerExecutionEnvironment]
        --
        +create_session_environment(): DockerExecutionEnvironment
        +get_session_environment(): Optional[DockerExecutionEnvironment]
        +cleanup_session(): void
        +cleanup_all_sessions(): void
        +list_active_sessions(): List[str]
        +get_session_count(): int
        +get_sandbox_config(): Dict[str, Any]
    }

    class DockerExecutionEnvironment {
        +session_id: str
        +sandbox_config: Dict[str, Any]
        +container: Container
        +docker_client: DockerClient
        --
        +start(): void
        +stop(): void
        +execute_command(): CommandResult
        +copy_to_container(): void
        +copy_from_container(): void
        +get_container_id(): str
        +is_healthy(): bool
    }

    class CommandResult <<stereototype C>> {
        +exit_code: int
        +stdout: str
        +stderr: str
        +execution_time: float
    }
}

' Inheritance relationships
CommandExecutor <|-- DockerExecutor
DockerExecutor <|-- CLIExecutor
DockerExecutor <|-- PythonExecutor

' Execution Manager composition relationships
ExecutionManager *-- ExecutorFactory
ExecutionManager *-- ExecutionConfiguration
ExecutionManager *-- SandboxManager
ExecutionManager *-- SecurityValidator

' Factory relationships
ExecutorFactory ..> CLIExecutor : creates
ExecutorFactory ..> PythonExecutor : creates
ExecutorFactory *-- SandboxManager
ExecutorFactory *-- SecurityValidator
ExecutorFactory *-- ExecutionConfiguration

' Sandbox relationships
SandboxManager *-- DockerExecutionEnvironment
DockerExecutor *-- SandboxManager
DockerExecutionEnvironment ..> CommandResult

' Component relationships
CommandExecutor *-- Parameter
Parameter ..> ParameterType
SecurityValidator ..> SecurityConstants

' Usage relationships
CommandExecutor ..> CommandResult
CommandExecutor ..> ValidationResult

note top of ExecutionManager
**Docker Sandbox Execution Manager**
Central hub for all command execution components including:
- Factory-based executor management for scalable executor types
- Configuration management and security enforcement
- Security validation performed before command execution
- Sandbox manager for Docker container lifecycle management
- Command listing for REST API integration
- Execution monitoring and concurrency control
- MCP tools integration for multiple executor types
- Dynamic executor type determination based on command analysis
end note

note right of ExecutorFactory
**Executor Factory Pattern**
Scalable factory for managing multiple executor types:
- Registry-based executor management
- Dynamic executor creation and selection
- Command analysis for automatic executor type detection
- MCP schema generation for all registered executors
- Supports easy addition of new executor types
end note

note top of CommandExecutor
Base command execution framework:
- Parameter management and validation
- MCP schema generation
- Abstract execute method for command-specific implementation
end note

note bottom of CLIExecutor
Docker-based CLI command implementation inheriting from DockerExecutor.
Provides command execution in isolated Docker containers.
Requires SandboxManager for container management.
Security validation handled at ExecutionManager level before execution.
Session-based container isolation with automatic cleanup.
end note

note bottom of PythonExecutor
Docker-based Python script execution inheriting from DockerExecutor.
Supports dependency installation via pip/uv and script templates.
Provides code validation and secure Python environment execution.
Uses uv for Python package management and script execution.
end note

note left of SecurityValidator
Multi-layer security validation (used by ExecutionManager):
- Command whitelisting
- Pattern detection for dangerous constructs
- Argument sanitization
- Path safety validation
end note

note right of SandboxManager
Docker container lifecycle management:
- Session-based container creation and management
- Container health monitoring
- Automatic cleanup on session end
- Docker environment configuration
end note

note top of Parameter
Core parameter and result types supporting
command execution and MCP schema generation.
All data models unified under execution manager.
end note

@enduml
